2.25.1

        You will be given the root cause of a bug, the commit message and the corresponding patch.
        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by incorrect handling of the D-Bus API properties related to system call filtering and address family restrictions. Specifically, the wrong data structures were being used (`c->address_families` instead of `c->syscall_filter`), and the message formatting for these properties was not properly structured, leading to potential miscommunication with the D-Bus interface.

        Commit message:
        core: fix D-Bus API

This fixes bugs introduced by cffaed83e87bde81378b2be74192193850d0e03a.

Closes #7129.  

